Subject: [PATCH 11/22] feat(tools): local try-it page for the Phase 1 + 2
 auto-editor

tools/phase2/try_it.py serves http://127.0.0.1:8765 (loopback only):
upload a video, pick the niche, clip count, selection (fixed, or AI with
the owner's free Groq key read from a .env path he gives), and for
gaming the "face on top" template and credit. It runs auto_edit.py (the
production pipeline functions) and shows progress, the finished clips
and the QC report. Nothing touches the installed app, its .env or its
database. _winshim/fcntl.py is the Windows stub the pipeline imports
need outside Docker.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
